# Checkers: the pieces on a dark square, 3 bytes (21 pixels) by 19 lines: a white man (solid), a
# black man (a white rim round black), their kings (a ring inside the white one, a disc inside the
# black one), and the mark of a square a piece can move to. Made for this program.

